@page "/burser/help"
@layout paa_frontend.Client.Layout.BurserPortalLayout
<div class="help-page"><h1>Finance help centre</h1><p class="lead">A friendly guide to student accounts and school finances.</p><section><h2>Students and accounts</h2><p>Search for the learner first, then confirm the name and class before opening the account. Review the balance and account history before answering a payment question.</p></section><section><h2>Recording a transaction</h2><p>Choose the correct learner, payment type, amount, date, and reference. Review everything before saving. Give the payer a receipt or reference where your school process requires one.</p></section><section><h2>Fees and exchange rates</h2><p>Fee setup controls the charges available to the school. Exchange rates should be updated only from the school’s agreed rate and checked before financial reports are prepared.</p></section><section><h2>Reports</h2><p>Use reports to review collections, balances, and transaction activity for a selected period. Check the date range and currency before exporting or sharing a report.</p></section><section><h2>When something is wrong</h2><p>Do not enter a second payment to correct a mistake. Check the original transaction and follow the school’s correction process, keeping the reference number available.</p></section></div><style>.help-page{max-width:900px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 20px;color:#0f172a}.help-page h1{font-size:32px;margin:0 0 8px}.lead{color:#64748b;margin-bottom:26px}.help-page section{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:18px;padding:20px;margin:14px 0;box-shadow:0 4px 14px #0f172a0a}.help-page h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 8px}.help-page p{line-height:1.65;color:#475569}</style>
